+        <li><strong>Session Token Lifetime:</strong> {DATA_MINIMIZATION_POLICY.sessionTTLSeconds / 3600} hours (strictly <code>HttpOnly</code>, <code>SameSite=Strict</code>).</li>
+        <li><strong>Prohibited PII Fields Rejected at API Boundary:</strong> <code>{DATA_MINIMIZATION_POLICY.prohibitedUserFields.join(', ')}</code>.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>4. Verified Security Headers Baseline</h2>
+    <p>
+        All application routes and API responses are wrapped by our security middleware to guarantee defense-in-depth against XSS, clickjacking, MIME sniffing, and cross-origin data leakage:
+    </p>
+    <div class="not-prose bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono overflow-x-auto space-y-2">
+        {Object.entries(SECURITY_HEADERS).map(([name, val]) => (
