+<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy & Data Governance">
+    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
+        <strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 20, 2026 | <strong>Policy Version:</strong> 2.0 (Privacy by Design &amp; Data Minimization)
