+            <li><code>{key}</code>: <span class="text-xs break-all font-mono text-gray-600">{value}</span></li>
+        ))}
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>5. Third-Party Audits &amp; Service Transparency</h2>
+    <p>
+        All third-party integrations undergo formal security and privacy audits before deployment. Currently, <strong>{THIRD_PARTY_AUDIT_REGISTRY.length}</strong> integrations are cataloged in our registry. View the complete interactive findings on our <a href={`${baseUrl}legal/audit`}>Third-Party Security &amp; Privacy Audit Report</a> page or inspect the machine-readable JSON feed at <a href={`${baseUrl}api/privacy-audit.json`}><code>/api/privacy-audit.json</code></a>.
